# e2e zero-loss render harness — local-only, regenerated artifacts. The harness
# CODE (render.mjs / compare.mjs / harness-real.*) is committed ; these are not :
#  - certs/  : self-signed HTTPS certs for the local Vite server (generate locally)
#  - assets/ : full-res REST-imported images (heavy binaries)
#  - bundle.json : the imported bundle (regenerated by import-rest-live)
**/tests/e2e/zero-loss/real/certs/
**/tests/e2e/zero-loss/real/assets/
**/tests/e2e/zero-loss/real/bundle.json
